# fixedbugs, defect 157 widened, lane land186, 2026-10-02, the shape beside
# the handle at depth one: `typedef union TU {…} TU;` gives the tag and the
# typedef one name, so the question unit answers *a type* and no kind; the
# message says a tag of another kind, and the note what each kind takes,
# the union's being `record TU` with no `tag`.

extern "fixedbugs-157-unions.h"
    record T2 tag TU  #~ ffi_tag_is_a_union
        i: i32

function touch(t: T2) -> i32
    return t.i

function main()
    print(1)
